insert into public.ao_schedule_sources (id,branch_id,relative_path,sha256,kind,extraction_method,content,metadata) values ('37009c82c259688bf51a83ea3ab44662','AV','(AV) Alexandra Village/Pricelist/AV P1-2.pdf','24d22cbce9180612304626bcfddb91bfcac1f1ed84cdd0488573397c5a223601','pricing','pdf-text','PAGE 1
Terms & Conditions
     1.   The following tables will illustrate the PER LESSON RATES:

         Primary 1 – 2                 Academic Fees                 Academic Fees                Academic Fees            Standard Rate /
                                       1 or 2 Subjects*           3 or more Subjects**                   (Lite)                Trial Rate
     Term 1 and Term 3
       Number of Lessons to                     12                            12                        8 - 11                       1
       Purchase Per Subject
     Term 2 and Term 4                          14                            14                       10 - 13                       1
       Number of Lessons to
       Purchase Per Subject

       Rate Per Lesson                         $74                           $69                          $83                      $92


               ❖    To be eligible for the per lesson rate shown under 1 or 2 Subjects column, students must purchase a
                    minimum of 12 lessons of the same subject in Term 1 and 3 and 14 lessons of the same subject in
                    Term 2 and 4*
               ❖    Siblings from the same family can pool together their lessons to enjoy further discounted rate when
                    they purchase in 3 or more Subjects**

     2.   Payment Details
     •    Each new student1 is required to pay a one-time Registration Fee (inclusive of material fee) of S$80.00 prior to
          the start of their lessons.
     •    For cheque payment, please cross and make payable to: Aspire Hub Education Pte Ltd
     •    For paynow payment, please pay to UEN: 201000565G
     •    Payment can only be processed at the respective branch where the classes are attended.
     •    Full payment for lessons must be made before students are allowed to attend classes.
     •    An additional flat 10% interest fee will be charged based on the outstanding lesson fees for any late payment made
          after 14 days and beyond.

     3.   Lesson Credits
     •    Strictly no refund will be given in any circumstances.
     •    The duration of each lesson credit is 2 hours.
     •    It is the student or parent''s responsibility to arrange for any missed or cancelled lessons within the respective term.
     •    In the event that a student missed the said lesson within the respective term, lesson will not be able to be retrieved
          due to the automated attendance marking system.
     •    All lesson credits purchased must be completed within the stated term. Any lessons unutilized will expire by the
          end of the term.
     •    Aspire Hub Education reserves the right to replace a coach for subject(s) if the coach is unable to teach due to
          unforeseen circumstances.
     •    Aspire Hub Education reserves the right to suspend the conduct of trial lessons during crucial academic periods.
     •    Aspire Hub Education reserves the right to suspend in-person classes to adhere to regulatory requirements and/ or
          when it is in the best interest of our students and staff to do so. We will arrange for our students to continue their
          learning online. Under these circumstances, we are unable to offer any refund or discount on the fees and lessons
          have to be completed within the stipulated term.
     •    Aspire Hub Education reserves the right to amend the terms and conditions without prior notice.
Academic Calendar
                             Period                                                   Dates
                              Term 1                             28 December 2026 – 21 March 2027
                              Term 2                                 22 March 2027 – 27 June 2027
                              Term 3                              28 June 2027 – 12 September 2027
                              Term 4                          13 September 2027 – 19 December 2027


1New students include former students who are re-enrolling after having discontinued lessons for a period of one (1) year or
more.','{"pages":1,"links":[]}') on conflict do nothing;
