2. Payment Details
Each new student! is required to pay a one-time Registration and Material Fee of $$80.00 prior to the start of their lessons.

.

e For cheque payment, please cross and make payable to: ASPIRE HUB EDUCATION CENTRE (JUNIOR) PTE LTD.

e For PayNow payment, please pay to UEN: 201803623G. Please indicate child''s name and level.

e Payment can only be processed at the respective branch where the classes are attended.

e Full payment for lessons must be made before students are allowed to attend classes.

e Anadditional flat 10% interest fee will be charged based on the outstanding lesson fees for any late payment made
after 14 days.

3. Terms & Conditions

a. The duration of each lesson is 2 hours.

b. Strictly no refund is allowed after payment is made.

c. Alllessons purchased must be utilised within the stated term. Any unutilised lesson(s) will automatically expire by the end
of the term.

d. It is the student''s or parent''s responsibility to arrange with the centre for any missed or cancelled lessons within the

respective terms.
e. If your child cannot attend the scheduled class, kindly inform the centre via text or WhatsApp 9627 9470 at least 4 hours
prior to the start of the class. Failure to do so will result in forfeiture of the lesson.
f. Aspire Hub Education reserves the right to replace a coach for the subject(s) if the coach is unable to teach due to
unforeseen circumstances.
Aspire Hub Education reserves the right to suspend the conduct of trial lessons during crucial academic periods..
Aspire Hub Education reserves the right to suspend in-person classes to adhere to regulatory requirements and/ or when
itis in the best interest of our students and staff to do so. We will arrange for our students to continue their learning online.
Under these circumstances, we are unable to offer any refund or discount on the fees and lessons have to be
completed within the stipulated term.
