  ** Siblings from the same family can pool together their lessons to enjoy a further discounted rate when they purchase 3 or
  more subjects.

 2.   Payment Details
 ●    Each new student         1  is required to pay a one-time          Registration    and Material Fee of S$80.00           prior to the start of     their lessons.

 ●    For cheque payment, please cross and make payable to:                           ASPIRE HUB EDUCATION CENTRE @ WOODLEIGH PTE LTD.
 ●    For PayNow payment, please pay to UEN:                    202306234H  .      Please indicate child’s name and level.
 ●    Payment can only be processed at the respective branch where the classes are attended.
 ●    Full payment for lessons must be made before students are allowed to attend classes.
 ●    An additional flat 10% interest fee will be charged based on the outstanding lesson fees for any late payment made
      after 14 days.

 3.   Terms & Conditions
 a.   The duration of each lesson is 2 hours.
 b.   Strictly no refund is allowed after payment is made.
 c.   All  lessons   purchased      must    be   utilised  within  the  stated    term.   Any   unutilised   lesson(s)   will  automatically      expire   by  the  end
      of the term.
 d.   It  is  the  student’s    or  parent’s     responsibility    to   arrange     with   the   centre    for  any   missed     or  cancelled      lessons   within   the
      respective terms.
 e.   If  your  child  cannot     attend    the   scheduled      class,   kindly  inform    the  centre    via  text  or  WhatsApp       8332    2251   at  least  4  hours
      prior to the start of the class. Failure to do so will result in forfeiture of the lesson.
 f.   Aspire    Hub   Education       reserves    the   right  to  replace     a  coach     for  the  subject(s)    if  the  coach    is  unable   to  teach    due    to
      unforeseen circumstances.
 g.   Aspire Hub Education reserves the right to suspend the conduct of trial lessons during crucial academic periods..
 h.   Aspire   Hub    Education      reserves    the  right  to  suspend     in-person    classes   to  adhere    to  regulatory     requirements      and/    or  when
      it  is  in  the  best  interest  of  our  students  and  staff  to  do  so.  We   will  arrange   for  our  students    to  continue    their  learning    online.
      Under     these    circumstances,        we    are    unable     to  offer   any    refund    or  discount      on   the   fees   and    lessons   have     to  be
      completed within the stipulated term.
 i.   Aspire Hub Education reserves the right to amend the terms and conditions without prior notice.

